                    <p>Company that can offer shares to public, list on NSE/BSE, and has unlimited shareholders with free share transfer. Name ends Limited. SPICe+ with RoC Delhi. INC-20A within 180 days. For <a href="#">DSC</a>, see our page.</p>
                    <p>Highest compliance: AGM mandatory, board every 120 days, statutory audit, independent directors if threshold, company secretary if Rs 10 Cr+. For <a href="/statutory-audit">Statutory Audit</a>, see our page.</p>

                </div>
                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-top:20px;">
                    <p><strong>Key Terms for Public Ltd Registration:</strong></p>
                    <ul><li><strong>S2(71):</strong> Public company. 7+ shareholders, 3+ directors. Shares freely transferable. Can IPO</li><li><strong>INC-20A:</strong> Commencement declaration within 180 days. Without = cannot operate. Rs 50K penalty</li><li><strong>Independent Directors:</strong> Listed: 1/3. Unlisted: if Rs 10 Cr capital / Rs 100 Cr turnover / Rs 50 Cr loans</li><li><strong>IPO:</strong> SEBI regulated. DRHP. 3 years financials. Profitability. LODR compliance</li><li><strong>Free Transfer:</strong> Shares transferable without restriction. vs Private (restricted, max 200)</li><li><strong>Company Secretary:</strong> Mandatory if paid-up Rs 10 Cr+. Secretarial audit for listed</li></ul>

                </div>
            </div>
